      "text": "SCOPE + TRADE-OFFS\nDocker is the implemented provider\nE2B is an optional future adapter\nSingle Postgres is not high availability\nLocal resource caps limit concurrency\nShared verifier isolation is imperfect\nOperational evidence: docs/VALIDATION.md",
